src/spectral_table.rs contains camera matrices fitted by the LightCraft contributors from
rawtoaces-data v1.1.0 (Academy Software Foundation, Apache-2.0), commit
5cfa53707b053594b2d0d48e8019fb56e6582d6c, and the CIE 1931 colour-matching functions
it ships (CIE, CC-BY-4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source: https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/rawtoaces-data
Camera sensitivities were measured by Weta Digital, scitech, and Jonathon Irons at the National
Physical Laboratory. The fitted matrices are derived data; aliases were copied from data/aliases.json.
Full upstream attribution is retained in ../../ATTRIBUTION.md in the vendored tree.
